&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Systems Engineer, you will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;the technical outcome of complex space missions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;During mission contracting and requirements development, you may work with the sales engineering org to ensure mission requirements are valid and mission scope is adequately defined. Systems Engineers translate higher level requirements down to lower-level requirements, consulting and collaborating with discipline team-leads and subject matter experts where necessary.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
