&lt;li&gt;Review salary offers and act as a trusted advisor for compensation decisions across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the annual salary review cycle, ensuring consistency and competitiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and continuously improve bonus and commission programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own HR budgeting, personnel cost planning and forecasting processes&lt;/li&gt;
